(5456526, 785726, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  I feel that the lighting is not strong enough on the top portion, even though it''s strong enough to cast a shadow of the bulb.</td>', 'Great subject.  I feel that the lighting is not strong enough on the top portion, even though it''s strong enough to cast a shadow of the bulb.', '2009-04-29 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
