(5456529, 786115, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I wish this was just a bit sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I wish this was just a bit sharper.', '2009-04-29 01:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456532, 785734, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.', '2009-04-29 01:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456534, 785305, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Wonderful b/w conversion.</td>', 'Great image.  Wonderful b/w conversion.', '2009-04-29 02:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456535, 786298, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Love the desat and the tilt.  Border really anchors the image.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Love the desat and the tilt.  Border really anchors the image.', '2009-04-29 02:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456539, 785902, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great pooch shot!  Just a little less air on the right would balance the shot a little more.</td>', 'Great pooch shot!  Just a little less air on the right would balance the shot a little more.', '2009-04-29 02:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456546, 785059, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Very nicely shot but it''s not coming together for me.  It''s like everything has the same importance, with nothing predominant as the actual subject.  The sky is very interesting and bold, the corn is very sharp and textured and colorful, the beakers have great clarity and shine.  There''s too much to look at and nothing to decisively focus on.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Very nicely shot but it''s not coming together for me.  It''s like everything has the same importance, with nothing predominant as the actual subject.  The sky is very interesting and bold, the corn is very sharp and textured and colorful, the beakers have great clarity and shine.  There''s too much to look at and nothing to decisively focus on.', '2009-04-29 02:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456548, 786036, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and colors.  A bit of a shoehorn though...</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and colors.  A bit of a shoehorn though...', '2009-04-29 02:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456588, 786197, 90624, '<td valign="top">OH no not the woodies!!!</td>', 'OH no not the woodies!!!', '2009-04-29 02:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456590, 785680, 90624, '<td valign="top">very cool re purpose though!</td>', 'very cool re purpose though!', '2009-04-29 02:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456617, 785061, 47487, '<td valign="top">Great photo (LOVE the flying dirt), but... I don''t even have to say it; you''ve probably heard it at least a few times already... :)</td>', 'Great photo (LOVE the flying dirt), but... I don''t even have to say it; you''ve probably heard it at least a few times already... :)', '2009-04-29 03:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456618, 785939, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Could be an ad.</td>', 'Very clever. Could be an ad.', '2009-04-29 03:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456619, 785567, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and a good sentiment but it would be more effective if the items were more readily recognizable.</td>', 'Nicely captured and a good sentiment but it would be more effective if the items were more readily recognizable.', '2009-04-29 03:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456624, 786261, 47487, '<td valign="top">Lovely items. The picture is well-taken; I love the perspective. But it looks maybe a tiny bit cramped. More negative space might be nice above the top flower.</td>', 'Lovely items. The picture is well-taken; I love the perspective. But it looks maybe a tiny bit cramped. More negative space might be nice above the top flower.', '2009-04-29 03:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456626, 785504, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great idea just a shame the background isn''t quite black enough to make the black card on which the bulb is standing disappear. If you have PS try lowering the Offset in the Exposure menu.</td>', 'Great idea just a shame the background isn''t quite black enough to make the black card on which the bulb is standing disappear. If you have PS try lowering the Offset in the Exposure menu.', '2009-04-29 03:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456629, 785902, 99506, '<td valign="top">My first thought was, can''t see the connection to the challenge, but now I look longer I get it... golf ball recycling yeah lol. Nice idea and excellent composition</td>', 'My first thought was, can''t see the connection to the challenge, but now I look longer I get it... golf ball recycling yeah lol. Nice idea and excellent composition', '2009-04-29 03:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456631, 785950, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge</td>', 'Great take on the challenge', '2009-04-29 03:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456633, 785837, 99506, '<td valign="top">Even if this bus is going up a hill I think Iwould have prefered to have seen it level.</td>', 'Even if this bus is going up a hill I think Iwould have prefered to have seen it level.', '2009-04-29 03:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456634, 785833, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. I think it would have been better if it was stood on a piece of curved card so that we didn''t see the line in the background but he colours are nice and vivid and I think the shadow actually adds to the over all affect.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. I think it would have been better if it was stood on a piece of curved card so that we didn''t see the line in the background but he colours are nice and vivid and I think the shadow actually adds to the over all affect.', '2009-04-29 03:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456636, 785061, 99506, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh the old MkII.... I had an RS2000 Custom myself.  Dalby Forrest? <br/>Nice take on the challenge and great capture on the stones</td>', 'Ahhhh the old MkII.... I had an RS2000 Custom myself.  Dalby Forrest? Nice take on the challenge and great capture on the stones', '2009-04-29 03:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456638, 784993, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good use of color and framing. Not sure how well it fits the challenge, and I wish there''d been just a slightly greater depth of field.</td>', 'Good use of color and framing. Not sure how well it fits the challenge, and I wish there''d been just a slightly greater depth of field.', '2009-04-29 04:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456639, 785843, 99506, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the crop. Perhaps smaller and to one side so it''s no so in our faces, but a good interpretation</td>', 'I''m not keen on the crop. Perhaps smaller and to one side so it''s no so in our faces, but a good interpretation', '2009-04-29 04:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456640, 785904, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever and lovely. Good job.</td>', 'Clever and lovely. Good job.', '2009-04-29 04:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456642, 785911, 99506, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cloned out that yellow mark on the pod and the over processing looks a little strange but good take on the challenge and a great title.</td>', 'I think I would have cloned out that yellow mark on the pod and the over processing looks a little strange but good take on the challenge and a great title.', '2009-04-29 04:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456643, 786217, 47487, '<td valign="top">Voting without considering the title, because I don''t see how growing a new plant is recycling (although it''s plenty "green"). This is a nicely-done shot.</td>', 'Voting without considering the title, because I don''t see how growing a new plant is recycling (although it''s plenty "green"). This is a nicely-done shot.', '2009-04-29 04:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456644, 784690, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever. I like the sharp focus on the tiny leaf.</td>', 'Clever. I like the sharp focus on the tiny leaf.', '2009-04-29 04:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456645, 786080, 99506, '<td valign="top">Very funny take on the challenge. IMO it would have been better with a some black card underneath and to the sides to give us more focus on the subject.</td>', 'Very funny take on the challenge. IMO it would have been better with a some black card underneath and to the sides to give us more focus on the subject.', '2009-04-29 04:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456646, 786022, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh, good idea for a shot for this challenge. And a good idea overall! :) (I don''t do it because it''s "green"; I do it because it''s cheap and you can''t beat the fresh smell.) :-) The photo itself is well-balanced with excellent sharpness and bokeh. I like.</td>', 'Ooh, good idea for a shot for this challenge. And a good idea overall! :) (I don''t do it because it''s "green"; I do it because it''s cheap and you can''t beat the fresh smell.) :-) The photo itself is well-balanced with excellent sharpness and bokeh. I like.', '2009-04-29 04:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456647, 785726, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice image and a good interpretation but a bit too central IMO.</td>', 'Nice image and a good interpretation but a bit too central IMO.', '2009-04-29 04:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456650, 785254, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, nicely composed. The light is lovely but it seems to cast attention on the field rather than on the generators. The clouds look a little grainy to me but I''m not going to vote down for that because this is a new monitor and I don''t trust it yet. :)</td>', 'Good choice of subject, nicely composed. The light is lovely but it seems to cast attention on the field rather than on the generators. The clouds look a little grainy to me but I''m not going to vote down for that because this is a new monitor and I don''t trust it yet. :)', '2009-04-29 04:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456653, 785680, 47487, '<td valign="top">Actually, I would call that clever reuse. If they''re holding up a teeter-totter they''re not filling up a landfill anyway. :)<br/> <br/>I like the angle of the shot and the line of the seesaw, but the background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Actually, I would call that clever reuse. If they''re holding up a teeter-totter they''re not filling up a landfill anyway. :) I like the angle of the shot and the line of the seesaw, but the background is a little distracting.', '2009-04-29 04:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456654, 785567, 99506, '<td valign="top">Good social comment image here</td>', 'Good social comment image here', '2009-04-29 04:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456655, 785164, 47487, '<td valign="top">Lovely motion capture. If I had to find something to complain about I''d say that I wished it wasn''t cropped so tightly, but overall a really good image.</td>', 'Lovely motion capture. If I had to find something to complain about I''d say that I wished it wasn''t cropped so tightly, but overall a really good image.', '2009-04-29 04:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456656, 786150, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a clever idea! :) <br/> <br/>I wish I could read more of the text, but this is a good capture nonetheless.</td>', 'What a clever idea! :)  I wish I could read more of the text, but this is a good capture nonetheless.', '2009-04-29 04:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456657, 785512, 99506, '<td valign="top">Funny take on the challenge just not sure if I like the lighting and he lens flare yet. Will come back and see if it grows on me lol</td>', 'Funny take on the challenge just not sure if I like the lighting and he lens flare yet. Will come back and see if it grows on me lol', '2009-04-29 04:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456658, 786285, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea</td>', 'Nice idea', '2009-04-29 04:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456659, 785468, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Wish the background was a bit darker so we couldn''t see that line.</td>', 'Great idea. Wish the background was a bit darker so we couldn''t see that line.', '2009-04-29 04:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456661, 786286, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s a fine picture of a recycling bin and it fits the challenge well, but the composition, light, angle, etc. aren''t terribly inspiring. Maybe a change in angle might make it a more compelling shot.</td>', 'It''s a fine picture of a recycling bin and it fits the challenge well, but the composition, light, angle, etc. aren''t terribly inspiring. Maybe a change in angle might make it a more compelling shot.', '2009-04-29 04:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456663, 786139, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I would have been tempted to clone out some of the specs towards to top right hand side</td>', 'Nice image, I would have been tempted to clone out some of the specs towards to top right hand side', '2009-04-29 04:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456664, 785853, 47487, '<td valign="top">Fascinating! Love the colors. Would be JUST a little nicer IMO if the crop had been tight enough to keep that one bit of open wall from showing in the upper left. Overall a great shot though!</td>', 'Fascinating! Love the colors. Would be JUST a little nicer IMO if the crop had been tight enough to keep that one bit of open wall from showing in the upper left. Overall a great shot though!', '2009-04-29 04:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456665, 786260, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good sentiment. I like the portrayal of mass transit with the "green" ad. The photo''s maybe a little busy but that''s not necessarily a BAD thing.</td>', 'Nicely done, good sentiment. I like the portrayal of mass transit with the "green" ad. The photo''s maybe a little busy but that''s not necessarily a BAD thing.', '2009-04-29 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456666, 784761, 47487, '<td valign="top">I''d knock this for DNMC if the vase weren''t a repurposed Coke can. :) Gorgeous shot.</td>', 'I''d knock this for DNMC if the vase weren''t a repurposed Coke can. :) Gorgeous shot.', '2009-04-29 04:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456667, 786211, 47487, '<td valign="top">Niiiice. I can''t find anything not to like in this picture. We drove across Hoover Dam a month ago but didn''t have time (or a parking spot!) to stop and take pictures. I was so disappointed. This shot doesn''t help because now I wish I''d taken it! :-)</td>', 'Niiiice. I can''t find anything not to like in this picture. We drove across Hoover Dam a month ago but didn''t have time (or a parking spot!) to stop and take pictures. I was so disappointed. This shot doesn''t help because now I wish I''d taken it! :-)', '2009-04-29 04:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456668, 786266, 47487, '<td valign="top">Love the way you put the sun behind the generator. A compelling composition! Good job.</td>', 'Love the way you put the sun behind the generator. A compelling composition! Good job.', '2009-04-29 04:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456669, 785734, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very nice product shot.</td>', 'Very nice product shot.', '2009-04-29 04:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456670, 786129, 47487, '<td valign="top">Clever title, nicely composed picture, just not sure I get why it''s in the dirt.</td>', 'Clever title, nicely composed picture, just not sure I get why it''s in the dirt.', '2009-04-29 04:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456673, 785726, 47487, '<td valign="top">Best use of this concept I''ve seen so far. Nice clean composition, well-lit, sharp. Great job.</td>', 'Best use of this concept I''ve seen so far. Nice clean composition, well-lit, sharp. Great job.', '2009-04-29 04:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456674, 786196, 47487, '<td valign="top">If they were recycled, wouldn''t they either have been turned into something else or be of use somehow? Pretty good picture, good color treatment, nice try on meeting the challenge but it just doesn''t quite do it for me.</td>', 'If they were recycled, wouldn''t they either have been turned into something else or be of use somehow? Pretty good picture, good color treatment, nice try on meeting the challenge but it just doesn''t quite do it for me.', '2009-04-29 04:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456676, 785911, 47487, '<td valign="top">Cute use of the iPod silhouette trademark. Nicely shot photo, too. Your poor plants are going to need more soil than that, though. ;-)</td>', 'Cute use of the iPod silhouette trademark. Nicely shot photo, too. Your poor plants are going to need more soil than that, though. ;-)', '2009-04-29 04:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456679, 784706, 99506, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what your image is but I love the title lol</td>', 'Can''t tell what your image is but I love the title lol', '2009-04-29 04:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456681, 786181, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice. Might have been even better if you guys weren''t transplanting a clover plant. ;-). Seriously, a really good shot and who cares what you''re planting, right? I like the color treatment here.</td>', 'Nice. Might have been even better if you guys weren''t transplanting a clover plant. ;-). Seriously, a really good shot and who cares what you''re planting, right? I like the color treatment here.', '2009-04-29 04:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456682, 785648, 99506, '<td valign="top">My guess is that this isn''t that writer as in my experience they won''t let you photograph their face lol<br/>Good interesting take on the challenge</td>', 'My guess is that this isn''t that writer as in my experience they won''t let you photograph their face lolGood interesting take on the challenge', '2009-04-29 04:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
