(5456697, 786281, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I think more coins so we can''t see whatever is below them and boost the green of the notes.</td>', 'Nice idea but I think more coins so we can''t see whatever is below them and boost the green of the notes.', '2009-04-29 04:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456699, 785000, 99506, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition.<br/>Seems a little over processed but that could just be the real affect of the paint</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition.Seems a little over processed but that could just be the real affect of the paint', '2009-04-29 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456701, 786298, 47487, '<td valign="top">Repurposing is one of my favorite concepts, and not even necessarily because it''s good for the environment -- it just makes sense. :) As for this photograph, I really like it -- the repetition is great, but there''s a lot of interest and variety at the same time. I am not ordinarily a fan of The Tilt but I think you''ve made a rare good use of it here. :)</td>', 'Repurposing is one of my favorite concepts, and not even necessarily because it''s good for the environment -- it just makes sense. :) As for this photograph, I really like it -- the repetition is great, but there''s a lot of interest and variety at the same time. I am not ordinarily a fan of The Tilt but I think you''ve made a rare good use of it here. :)', '2009-04-29 04:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5456703, 786217, 99506, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot without the green recycling box and perhaps dry soil in the hand.</td>', 'This would have been a great shot without the green recycling box and perhaps dry soil in the hand.', '2009-04-29 04:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
