(5457187, 784690, 38032, '<td valign="top">interesting.  I do like those keyboards.  I suppose this could be a laptop in the park.  Or a metaphor that nature is calling us to unplug and get out there without our "stuff".  I like it. 7</td>', 'interesting.  I do like those keyboards.  I suppose this could be a laptop in the park.  Or a metaphor that nature is calling us to unplug and get out there without our "stuff".  I like it. 7', '2009-04-29 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457191, 786150, 6817, '<td valign="top">Interesting thought.</td>', 'Interesting thought.', '2009-04-29 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457198, 786197, 6817, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but for some reason the group of figures and the basket being off center bothers me enough to notice it. Otherwise, great concept and use of green to help get the point across.</td>', 'I like this image, but for some reason the group of figures and the basket being off center bothers me enough to notice it. Otherwise, great concept and use of green to help get the point across.', '2009-04-29 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457199, 785254, 38032, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene.  It almost seems like the wind turbines enhance the scene here - like flowers.  Really a stunning man/landscape.</td>', 'A lovely scene.  It almost seems like the wind turbines enhance the scene here - like flowers.  Really a stunning man/landscape.', '2009-04-29 11:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457207, 785286, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''m going to go ahead and assume this has to do with mass consumption of plastic.  Barbie to me represents an unusual conformity and distortion of humanity; a waste of plastic. So this one works for me.</td>', 'I''m going to go ahead and assume this has to do with mass consumption of plastic.  Barbie to me represents an unusual conformity and distortion of humanity; a waste of plastic. So this one works for me.', '2009-04-29 11:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457221, 785952, 38032, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential and great colors.  The focus its there. The exposure and clarity are good. <br/>Conceptually, however, I don''t really get it.  I love the idea of bringing an electronic device out of the comfort of home ... but then what? - it seems to mock the entire idea of environmentalism - but not in a way that engages the viewer or makes a good point.  <br/>So while some criticize Superfund sites and the government''s involvement, I''m not sure this does that either - it seems too contrived.  Or maybe it is supposed to insinuate that hippies are crazy and out of touch ... I dunno.  The ingredients are there, but they don''t come together into a good tasting breakfast for me today.</td>', 'Lots of potential and great colors.  The focus its there. The exposure and clarity are good. Conceptually, however, I don''t really get it.  I love the idea of bringing an electronic device out of the comfort of home ... but then what? - it seems to mock the entire idea of environmentalism - but not in a way that engages the viewer or makes a good point.  So while some criticize Superfund sites and the government''s involvement, I''m not sure this does that either - it seems too contrived.  Or maybe it is supposed to insinuate that hippies are crazy and out of touch ... I dunno.  The ingredients are there, but they don''t come together into a good tasting breakfast for me today.', '2009-04-29 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457222, 786129, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Post-processing is a little sloppy, especially the front lower corner.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Post-processing is a little sloppy, especially the front lower corner.', '2009-04-29 11:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457233, 786298, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is one of those areas I''m not 100% sure about.  Is decoration a good reuse?  It begs the question here.  A nice image either way - the diagonal angle is effective and welcome.</td>', 'This is one of those areas I''m not 100% sure about.  Is decoration a good reuse?  It begs the question here.  A nice image either way - the diagonal angle is effective and welcome.', '2009-04-29 11:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457234, 785867, 38032, '<td valign="top">I can''t say that this helps me understand anything.  I suppose nature will persevere  regardless of how much garbage we create - but I''m not sure I get the photo as telling me much.</td>', 'I can''t say that this helps me understand anything.  I suppose nature will persevere  regardless of how much garbage we create - but I''m not sure I get the photo as telling me much.', '2009-04-29 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457239, 786203, 38032, '<td valign="top">The colors and DOF are nice here.  It, however, just reminds me how we are being "sold" into this movement rather than actually being this movement.</td>', 'The colors and DOF are nice here.  It, however, just reminds me how we are being "sold" into this movement rather than actually being this movement.', '2009-04-29 11:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457273, 785902, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I don''t see the connection to ecology.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I don''t see the connection to ecology.', '2009-04-29 12:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457290, 785853, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the composition isn''t really working for me.  It''s too chaotic and I can''t find any place for my eyes to settle.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the composition isn''t really working for me.  It''s too chaotic and I can''t find any place for my eyes to settle.', '2009-04-29 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
