(5457299, 784761, 102024, '<td valign="top">What a lovely shot!  The DOF works quite well and the arrangement and nuances of the flowers with the frog (?) make this shot very appealing.  Not entirely sure why you chose a Coke can specifically, but the color contrasts between the red of the can and the transition through the violets to the greens and whites works for me.</td>', 'What a lovely shot!  The DOF works quite well and the arrangement and nuances of the flowers with the frog (?) make this shot very appealing.  Not entirely sure why you chose a Coke can specifically, but the color contrasts between the red of the can and the transition through the violets to the greens and whites works for me.', '2009-04-29 12:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457303, 786080, 102024, '<td valign="top">Hmm... not sure I see "green" in this.  There''s a hint of the color green, but as far as the challenge description, isn''t this the opposite of green?</td>', 'Hmm... not sure I see "green" in this.  There''s a hint of the color green, but as far as the challenge description, isn''t this the opposite of green?', '2009-04-29 12:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
