(5457310, 786289, 102024, '<td valign="top">I do like the lighting, but I kinda wish the highlights weren''t blown out...</td>', 'I do like the lighting, but I kinda wish the highlights weren''t blown out...', '2009-04-29 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457317, 786217, 102024, '<td valign="top">The dirt is a little too "muddy" for me.  I like the whole potting soil dirty look because it has more design appeal than mud.  Plus the plant is a bit lack-luster.  This looks like a joining of two good ideas, but I''m not sure how they are connected visually.  I know what joins them but I''m not sure <i>why </i>you chose to join them like this.</td>', 'The dirt is a little too "muddy" for me.  I like the whole potting soil dirty look because it has more design appeal than mud.  Plus the plant is a bit lack-luster.  This looks like a joining of two good ideas, but I''m not sure how they are connected visually.  I know what joins them but I''m not sure why you chose to join them like this.', '2009-04-29 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457319, 785304, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well executed.  Good use of lighting.</td>', 'Well executed.  Good use of lighting.', '2009-04-29 12:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457351, 785286, 61961, '<td valign="top">Does Barbie have a tribal facial tattoo?  Interesting image, but I don''t see an ecology connection.</td>', 'Does Barbie have a tribal facial tattoo?  Interesting image, but I don''t see an ecology connection.', '2009-04-29 13:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457364, 786080, 43774, '<td valign="top">Are they cloth diapers? Because it''s hard to tell, they look like disposable diapers which really wouldn''t be good for the environment, would they?</td>', 'Are they cloth diapers? Because it''s hard to tell, they look like disposable diapers which really wouldn''t be good for the environment, would they?', '2009-04-29 13:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
