(5457407, 785304, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Great lighting and a really cool setup and very "DPC-friendly" as I like to say.  A flower and a lightbulb seem to be element associated with the green movement.  But to be a devil''s advocate: I''m not sure how this says "green" or environmentalism.  However, strangely, it works as a stock photo for the topic.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Great lighting and a really cool setup and very "DPC-friendly" as I like to say.  A flower and a lightbulb seem to be element associated with the green movement.  But to be a devil''s advocate: I''m not sure how this says "green" or environmentalism.  However, strangely, it works as a stock photo for the topic.', '2009-04-29 13:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457412, 785101, 87808, '<td valign="top">much much better, a fantastic job H, well done</td>', 'much much better, a fantastic job H, well done', '2009-04-29 13:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457413, 785950, 38032, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  People might not realize that compost bins can eliminate the need for fertilizer.  Not that I would use fertilizer anyway.</td>', 'Excellent.  People might not realize that compost bins can eliminate the need for fertilizer.  Not that I would use fertilizer anyway.', '2009-04-29 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
