(5459238, 785254, 3087, '<td valign="top">Score 8: Lovely scene, I don''t know why so many people insist these are a blight on the landscape - to my mind they allow us to preserve swathes of land that might otherwise be blighted by industrial power stations.</td>', 'Score 8: Lovely scene, I don''t know why so many people insist these are a blight on the landscape - to my mind they allow us to preserve swathes of land that might otherwise be blighted by industrial power stations.', '2009-04-30 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
