(5459248, 786129, 3087, '<td valign="top">Score 9: Simple concept so beautifully executed with such wonderful gritty textures and great shallow DOF. And such an unconventional composition too, which I like.</td>', 'Score 9: Simple concept so beautifully executed with such wonderful gritty textures and great shallow DOF. And such an unconventional composition too, which I like.', '2009-04-30 18:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
