(5463891, 786211, 98022, '<td valign="top">Really like the perspective of this shot and the contrast between the color /smoothness of the concrete and the rough natural rocks. 9 fom me.</td>', 'Really like the perspective of this shot and the contrast between the color /smoothness of the concrete and the rough natural rocks. 9 fom me.', '2009-05-02 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5463894, 785101, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and it''s pretty well executed here.  The colors are rather subtle, but I won''t say that is a negative at this point.... is it just me or is the light bulb off center?  I think in such a composition it would be better off being centered.</td>', 'I like the idea and it''s pretty well executed here.  The colors are rather subtle, but I won''t say that is a negative at this point.... is it just me or is the light bulb off center?  I think in such a composition it would be better off being centered.', '2009-05-02 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464086, 786129, 99506, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of the old and the new energy efficient bulb, I especially like the concept of the old bulb being out of focus as if it''s day is done. Nice work</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of the old and the new energy efficient bulb, I especially like the concept of the old bulb being out of focus as if it''s day is done. Nice work', '2009-05-02 16:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464268, 786115, 88580, '<td valign="top">The bright patch of sky competes a little bit with your giants.  Overall, it is a very pleasing composition.  The rolling hills and fences could maybe be a touch brighter to bring out some more detail, but on the other hand, the range of tones they add to the image is beneficial.  I really like the B/W conversion.  I''d like to see the color version, too.</td>', 'The bright patch of sky competes a little bit with your giants.  Overall, it is a very pleasing composition.  The rolling hills and fences could maybe be a touch brighter to bring out some more detail, but on the other hand, the range of tones they add to the image is beneficial.  I really like the B/W conversion.  I''d like to see the color version, too.', '2009-05-02 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464283, 785833, 88580, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little off, and the lighting is harsh, but I did get a chuckle from this image.  Your superhero looks like a cross between Little Red Riding Hood and Elvis.  :)</td>', 'The focus seems a little off, and the lighting is harsh, but I did get a chuckle from this image.  Your superhero looks like a cross between Little Red Riding Hood and Elvis.  :)', '2009-05-02 18:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464294, 785837, 88580, '<td valign="top">Good job with the panning; the sharpness of the bus is quite impressive.</td>', 'Good job with the panning; the sharpness of the bus is quite impressive.', '2009-05-02 18:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464306, 785648, 88580, '<td valign="top">This is probably too far out of the box to be fully appreciated.</td>', 'This is probably too far out of the box to be fully appreciated.', '2009-05-02 18:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464313, 786211, 88580, '<td valign="top">A dynamic, breathtaking perspective, and I love the processing.</td>', 'A dynamic, breathtaking perspective, and I love the processing.', '2009-05-02 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464319, 785952, 88580, '<td valign="top">lol.  That is just sooo wrong, maaaan.</td>', 'lol.  That is just sooo wrong, maaaan.', '2009-05-02 18:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464333, 786196, 88580, '<td valign="top">To me, the focus seems soft--or maybe it was done in post--either way, it''s a strange counterpoint to the gritty nature of the subject matter.  Don''t get me wrong, I actually like it.  It just seems odd.  There''s a lot going on, and it''s interesting to look at.  I get drawn to these sorts of scenes myself.</td>', 'To me, the focus seems soft--or maybe it was done in post--either way, it''s a strange counterpoint to the gritty nature of the subject matter.  Don''t get me wrong, I actually like it.  It just seems odd.  There''s a lot going on, and it''s interesting to look at.  I get drawn to these sorts of scenes myself.', '2009-05-02 18:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464335, 786266, 88580, '<td valign="top">I like where you put the horizon.  It emphasizes the grandness of the towers.  The sun''s position is awesome, too.  The banding around the sun is unfortunate.</td>', 'I like where you put the horizon.  It emphasizes the grandness of the towers.  The sun''s position is awesome, too.  The banding around the sun is unfortunate.', '2009-05-02 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464336, 786036, 88580, '<td valign="top">I nice standard wine glass shot.  Pretty loose tie to the theme, though.</td>', 'I nice standard wine glass shot.  Pretty loose tie to the theme, though.', '2009-05-02 18:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464340, 786260, 88580, '<td valign="top">Very good, original idea.  Well executed.</td>', 'Very good, original idea.  Well executed.', '2009-05-02 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5464369, 785952, 28742, '<td valign="top">Duuuuude - you need a bigger vacuum.</td>', 'Duuuuude - you need a bigger vacuum.', '2009-05-02 19:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
