(5465957, 786080, 105438, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how this is a "green" photo. If they were cloth, yes, but these are disposables. Not what most people would consider "green".</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how this is a "green" photo. If they were cloth, yes, but these are disposables. Not what most people would consider "green".', '2009-05-03 18:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465962, 786181, 105438, '<td valign="top">Love this photo. Simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Love this photo. Simple and beautiful.', '2009-05-03 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5465984, 786129, 105438, '<td valign="top">At first glance I really liked this photo. But then I noticed the distinct line at the edge of the blur and the streak in the upper right corner. I like the idea though. Seems like this was a good photo that needed better post processing.</td>', 'At first glance I really liked this photo. But then I noticed the distinct line at the edge of the blur and the streak in the upper right corner. I like the idea though. Seems like this was a good photo that needed better post processing.', '2009-05-03 18:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
